WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:04.350
 Hi, I'm Lauren, and today
I'm becoming Black Widow.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.801
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.630
What draws me personally
to the characters

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.460
that I choose to
cosplay has always

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.030
been some sort of
shared connection

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:22.170
that I have with that character,
thinking about her, where she's

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:27.780
been who she is and appreciating
her every step of the way

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.360
the same way this
character has helped

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.790
me learn to appreciate myself.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:40.530
Over eight years,
I have put together

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:45.490
25 or 26 different looks.

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:50.670
In a time in your life when
you might feel lost and afraid

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.520
and alone, these
films will come along,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.580
and they will make
you feel less alone.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:01.260
You'll also meet people in
your life who keep you going

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.069
and who are your Avengers.

00:01:05.069 --> 00:01:10.470
The Black Widow community is
how everyone shares everything.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:15.210
Even when you're in a solitary
creative process in this hobby,

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:17.400
there is a sense
of collaboration

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.370
because everyone wants to share.

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:23.880
I had been a long time
admirer of Lauren's work

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:24.790
on the internet.

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:27.220
 I was really welcomed
into the community.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.820
Especially the Black Widow
community on Instagram

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:33.260
is really supportive, and
that's how I met Lauren.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.310
 One of my most,
like, awe-filled

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:42.820
moments was honestly when I saw
Lauren's Avengers 2012 suit.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.520
Two of us coast to
coast who are each

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:49.630
going to do the very best
version of this costume

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.160
that we absolutely can.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:56.620
It really was just about
building each other up as well

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:58.510
as giving each other guidance.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:02.170
 I was able to share what I
had already learned, you know,

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.840
what I had the extra
time to research

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.920
and to try out on my own.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.280
I was able to sort of
pass it along to her

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:14.320
so that she could also create
the best possible costume.

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:15.580
And I sketched it out.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:18.880
I did a flat sketch in
Illustrator of the backpack,

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.800
and I was able to
send that to Lauren

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.555
to also help her
with her backpack.

00:02:22.555 --> 00:02:26.470
 Honestly, I never could
have made the backpack

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:28.480
without Lauren's help.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.050
I'm so grateful to her for it
because now that I've made it,

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:35.650
it is one of my favorite parts
of the costume that I made.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.570
 I think this is
the most effort

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:41.440
I've ever put into a build
before, and I think it shows.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.670
I hope it does, and I hope
the other little cosplay

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.060
players especially.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.140
I love to see it.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.820
 At the end of the day,
I just want to share

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.380
more love for Natasha always.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:58.840
If you are hesitating about
putting yourself out there

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.910
and opening yourself
up, there will

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.370
be people here to catch you.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.690
The Widows will always be there.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:09.030
ANNOUNCER: "Black
Widow," rated PF-13.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.210
Experience it now.

